5. THE NUMBERS THAT GO INTO THE ENTRY (3P2 alone)
-------------------------------------------------
  H298 = E(1s5) * h*c*N_A
       = 93143.7600 cm^-1 * 11.9626565957 J/(mol*cm^-1) = 1114.246815 kJ/mol -> 1114.247 kJ/mol
  (dfH298 = dfH0 exactly: [H298-H0] is 5/2 RT = 6.197 kJ/mol for BOTH Ar(1s5) and Ar,
   a single level having no internal structure to contribute; JANAF Ar-001 T=0 row gives
   -6.197 kJ/mol for the ground state, so the two cancel and E0 = H298.)

  S298 = S298(Ar, JANAF Ar-001) + R ln(g*/g0)
       = 154.845 + 8.3144626180 * ln(5/1) = 154.845 + 13.3816 = 168.226611 -> 168.227 J/(mol*K)

  Cp(T) = 5/2 R = 20.7861565450 -> 20.786 J/(mol*K) at EVERY T (translation only; one level)
  Cp0 = CpInf = 20.7862 J/(mol*K)

